{
  "id": "ECC.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Ecclesiastes 10",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dead flies cause the oil of the perfumer to send forth an evil odor; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " doth a little folly outweigh wisdom and honor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wise man’s heart is at his right hand; but a fool’s heart at his left. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea also, when the fool walketh by the way, his understanding faileth him, and he saith to every one ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " he is a fool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the spirit of the ruler rise up against thee, leave not thy place; for gentleness allayeth great offences.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is an evil which I have seen under the sun, as it were an error which proceedeth from the ruler: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "folly is set in great dignity, and the rich sit in a low place. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen servants upon horses, and princes walking like servants upon the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that diggeth a pit shall fall into it; and whoso breaketh through a wall, a serpent shall bite him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoso heweth out stones shall be hurt therewith; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " he that cleaveth wood is endangered thereby. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the iron be blunt, and one do not whet the edge, then must he put to more strength: but wisdom is profitable to direct. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the serpent bite before it is charmed, then is there no advantage in the charmer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of a wise man’s mouth are gracious; but the lips of a fool will swallow up himself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beginning of the words of his mouth is foolishness; and the end of his talk is mischievous madness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A fool also multiplieth words: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " man knoweth not what shall be; and that which shall be after him, who can tell him? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The labor of fools wearieth every one of them; for he knoweth not how to go to the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe to thee, O land, when thy king is a child, and thy princes eat in the morning! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Happy art thou, O land, when thy king is the son of nobles, and thy princes eat in due season, for strength, and not for drunkenness! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By slothfulness the roof sinketh in; and through idleness of the hands the house leaketh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A feast is made for laughter, and wine maketh glad the life; and money answereth all things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Revile not the king, no, not in thy thought; and revile not the rich in thy bedchamber: for a bird of the heavens shall carry the voice, and that which hath wings shall tell the matter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ECC.11",
    "number": "11",
    "bookId": "ECC"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ECC.9",
    "number": "9",
    "bookId": "ECC"
  }
}